---
import { currentVersion } from '~/lib/project';

const releaseVersion = '1.2.0';

if (releaseVersion !== currentVersion) {
  throw new Error(
    `Website release highlights ${releaseVersion} do not match project version ${currentVersion}.`,
  );
}
---

<!-- ============ CHANGELOG ============ -->
<section id="whats-new" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="cl.eyebrow">Changelog</span>
    <h2 class="title" data-i18n="cl.title">What's new</h2>
    <p class="lead" data-i18n="cl.lead">The highlights from the newest Vitrine release, available without waiting for a network request.</p>
    <article class="changelog" data-release-version={releaseVersion}>
      <p class="ver"><span data-i18n="cl.version">Version</span> {releaseVersion}</p>
      <h3 data-i18n="cl.headline">Safer inputs, stronger foundations</h3>
      <ul>
        <li data-i18n="cl.h1"><strong>Free terminal capture and search move forward together.</strong> Basic <code>vgrab</code> remains free, while commands, recents, themes, and fonts handle multi-word Unicode queries consistently.</li>
        <li data-i18n="cl.h2"><strong>Local files fail safely.</strong> Source, recipe, preset, and custom-theme imports are bounded, reject non-files, and detect inputs that change while loading.</li>
        <li data-i18n="cl.h3"><strong>Sequoia is the new floor.</strong> Vitrine supports macOS 15 and later, qualifies Tahoe explicitly, and keeps universal Apple silicon and Intel downloads.</li>
        <li data-i18n="cl.h4"><strong>Release evidence is harder to fool.</strong> WebKit controls, coverage guardrails, memory journeys, updater packaging, and candidate digests are verified before publication.</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="more" href="https://github.com/johnny4young/vitrine/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md" data-i18n="cl.more">Read the full changelog →</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PRO ============ -->
<section id="pro" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Vitrine PRO</span>
    <h2 class="title" data-i18n="pro.title">Go PRO when you need more.</h2>
    <p class="lead" data-i18n="pro.lead">MIT-licensed and free to use. Core capture and editing remain free: no watermark, no resolution cap, no nags. PRO is an optional <strong>one-time</strong> license — no subscription.</p>
    <p class="meta" data-i18n="pro.evaluation" style="margin:14px auto 0;max-width:760px">There is <strong>no expiring trial</strong>. Use the free core for as long as you like, then upgrade only when Brand Kit, multi-size/carousel workflows, or advanced automation earn their keep.</p>
    <div class="pro-card">
      <div class="pro-price"><span class="pro-now">$19.99</span><span class="pro-was">$25</span><span class="pro-badge" data-i18n="pro.badge">Early bird · 2026 only</span></div>
      <p class="pro-note" data-i18n="pro.note">The current checkout price is <strong>$19.99</strong> as a one-time purchase. The planned regular price is <strong>$25</strong> after the 2026 launch period.</p>
      <ul class="pro-list">
        <li><span class="chk"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span> <span data-i18n="pro.l1">Brand Kit — your logo, handle, and accent as a watermark on every export</span></li>
        <li><span class="chk"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span> <span data-i18n="pro.l2">Multi-size one-pass export — every platform size into a folder in one go</span></li>
        <li><span class="chk"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"></path></svg></span> <span data-i18n="pro.l3">Advanced automation — general <code>vitrine</code> rendering, multi-size, batch, vpane, and Shortcuts (basic vgrab stays free)</span></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cta" style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://johnny4young.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/314e7d43-efa1-41be-a319-7474628e5185"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 8l4 3.5L12 5l4 6.5L20 8l-1.4 9.5H5.4z"></path></svg><span data-i18n="pro.cta1">Get Vitrine PRO</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" data-download href="/download"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3.5v11M7.5 10l4.5 4.5L16.5 10M5 19.5h14"></path></svg><span data-i18n="pro.cta2">Download free</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="meta" data-i18n="pro.foot" style="margin-top:16px;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:13px">Pay once, then activate in the app with the license key you receive by email. PRO prompts appear only when you invoke a PRO action, never at launch.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
